# MF Overhaul 0.4.6 (interim, while the column-decoding workflow runs): the cloud at 40 % launch was lower but still discrete
#   spheres flying apart, because puffs separate faster than they grow. Launch spread of every soil row now 15 % up and 60 %
#   sideways of vanilla (UHE 6;35;6 -> 3.6;5.3;3.6), so the 36-56 puffs stay within ~15 m of each other and overlap.
